00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:20,300
If not, the best you can hope for is to spend the rest of your life bedridden!

267
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:24,460
What are you doing?

268
00:18:28,740 --> 00:18:29,900
The poor leaf.

269
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:37,200
I'm just playing a little joke, that's all.

270
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:39,940
